# Ad-hoc screenshots of the running dashboard, which land in the repo root
# because that is where the browser tooling drops them. Scoped to the root
# (leading slash) so it cannot swallow a real asset under dashboard/ — there are
# no tracked PNGs today, and the day one arrives it should not be silently
# ignored because of a screenshot rule.
#
# They are worth ignoring rather than committing: a screenshot is a picture of
# one moment of a live site, it is stale within a day, and the site itself is
# the better reference.
/*.png

