# KK-Ω walk-forward raw paths. Regenerated in ~2 minutes by
# `python -m jobs.omega_research --force-experimental`; the *results* those
# three are summarised into are committed beside them. Ten megabytes of stitched
# path is a build product, not a record.
compute/backtests/omega/panel.csv
compute/backtests/omega/predictions.csv
compute/backtests/omega/training_means.csv
